<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 228-9 IN 50 OVERS V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 228-9 IN 50 OVERS V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 228 for nine wickets in their 50 overs against Sri Lanka in the third day-night limited overs match of the Singer World Series tournament on Friday.</p>
</text>
